<!--
    Phase 8.7: zero-height stand-in for a PreferenceCategory header row, used
    only inside the settings accordion (see BasePreferenceFragmentCompat),
    where the accordion header already names the group. The category itself
    stays in the preference tree — only its title row renders as nothing.
-->
